{"background_color":"#0b1e3a","description":"Reach is a relationship action agent for phone-first people — never let a warm connection go cold. It reads the screen, taps, types, and drafts replies, thank-yous, and reconnections from what's on record, and nothing sends without your approval. Working demo with fictional seed data; anything you add stays on your phone.","display":"standalone","icons":[{"purpose":"any","sizes":"any","src":"icon.svg","type":"image/svg+xml"}],"name":"Reach — never let a warm connection go cold","orientation":"portrait","scope":"./","short_name":"Reach","start_url":"./index.html","theme_color":"#0b1e3a"}